  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Resounding Voice</em></p>\n<p>You have found a way to increase your power using an outside tool. For 3 Cursed Energy you can create or imbue a megaphone for 1 minute that causes your words to affect a 60-foot cone. The megaphone has hit points equal to twice your CE score and damages the megaphone instead of your vocal chords when used in this way. When reduced to 0 hit points, the megaphone turns to dust.</p>",
